        "Abstract": "Current research on hate speech analysis is typically oriented towards monolingual and single classification tasks. This paper presents a new multilingual hate speech analysis dataset for English, Hindi, Arabic, French, German, and Spanish languages across multiple domains of hate speech - Abuse, Racism, Sexism, Religious Hate, and Extremism. The dataset was created by using a 3-layer annotation pipeline and a combination of monolingual, multilingual, and cross-lingual models."
